This sysext bundles binaries, libraries and data from Debian packages, as
dpkg installed them, except that patchelf rewrote the ELF interpreter and
library search path so they load the libraries in /usr/local/tools. The
patching happened at build time, on the date the image version starts with.

Each package keeps its own license. Its copyright file is in
/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright, and the license texts those files refer
to are in /usr/share/common-licenses.

This image was published on the tools release together with the source of
every package below, as tools-<version>-source.tar, and a tag on the commit
it was built from:
https://github.com/tesserac-ai/flatcar-packages/releases/tag/tools

